IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BCUSTQ.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT CUST-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-CUST-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
        RECORD KEY IS CU-CUST-ID
        FILE STATUS IS WS-CUST-ST.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD CUST-FILE.
01 CUST-REC.
   05 CU-CUST-ID PIC X(12).
   05 CU-CUST-TYPE PIC X(01).
   05 CU-CUST-STATUS PIC X(02).
   05 CU-CUST-NAME PIC X(60).
   05 CU-CUST-DOC-TYPE PIC X(04).
   05 CU-CUST-DOC PIC X(20).
   05 CU-CUST-BIRTH PIC 9(08).
   05 CU-CUST-RISK PIC X(02).
   05 CU-CUST-KYC PIC X(02).
   05 CU-CUST-ADDR PIC X(80).
   05 CU-CUST-CREATED PIC 9(08).
   05 CU-CUST-UPDATED PIC 9(08).
   05 CU-CUST-VERSION PIC 9(05).
   05 CU-CUST-HASH PIC X(16).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-CUST-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 WS-CUST-ST PIC X(02).

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LS-CUST-ID PIC X(12).
01 LS-OUT.
   05 LS-OUT-ID PIC X(12).
   05 LS-OUT-TYPE PIC X(01).
   05 LS-OUT-STATUS PIC X(02).
   05 LS-OUT-NAME PIC X(60).
   05 LS-OUT-DOC-TYPE PIC X(04).
   05 LS-OUT-DOC PIC X(20).
   05 LS-OUT-BIRTH PIC 9(08).
   05 LS-OUT-RISK PIC X(02).
   05 LS-OUT-KYC PIC X(02).
   05 LS-OUT-ADDR PIC X(80).
   05 LS-OUT-VERSION PIC 9(05).
   05 LS-OUT-HASH PIC X(16).
   05 LS-OUT-RC PIC X(02).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-CUST-ID LS-OUT.
    MOVE SPACES TO LS-OUT
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-CUST-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/data/cust.idx"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-CUST-PATH
    OPEN INPUT CUST-FILE
    IF WS-CUST-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE "35" TO LS-OUT-RC
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE LS-CUST-ID TO CU-CUST-ID
    READ CUST-FILE
    EVALUATE WS-CUST-ST
        WHEN "00" PERFORM COPY-OUT
        WHEN OTHER MOVE "23" TO LS-OUT-RC
    END-EVALUATE
    CLOSE CUST-FILE
    GOBACK.

COPY-OUT.
    MOVE CU-CUST-ID TO LS-OUT-ID
    MOVE CU-CUST-TYPE TO LS-OUT-TYPE
    MOVE CU-CUST-STATUS TO LS-OUT-STATUS
    MOVE CU-CUST-NAME TO LS-OUT-NAME
    MOVE CU-CUST-DOC-TYPE TO LS-OUT-DOC-TYPE
    MOVE CU-CUST-DOC TO LS-OUT-DOC
    MOVE CU-CUST-BIRTH TO LS-OUT-BIRTH
    MOVE CU-CUST-RISK TO LS-OUT-RISK
    MOVE CU-CUST-KYC TO LS-OUT-KYC
    MOVE CU-CUST-ADDR TO LS-OUT-ADDR
    MOVE CU-CUST-VERSION TO LS-OUT-VERSION
    MOVE CU-CUST-HASH TO LS-OUT-HASH
    MOVE "00" TO LS-OUT-RC.
